## Overflow Handling

The toolbar does not provide built-in responsive overflow behaviour. Users can implement custom overflow menus using a custom toolbar component.

The following example demonstrates an overflow menu pattern where less-used actions are grouped into a "more" dropdown, keeping the toolbar clean at any width.

